## Agent commands

```bash
cd scripts
npm run kodepraksis:tick          # next kodepraksis item → reports/kodepraksis-agent-latest.md
npm run kodepraksis:result -- --n N --status done --pr "<url>"
npm run perf:pipeline             # JMeter + Playwright baseline (see performance-agent/README.md)
```

Fallback ladder (kodepraksis): primary → partial → defer → wontfix. Skills: `.cursor/skills/stardesk-kodepraksis-agent/`, `.cursor/skills/stardesk-performance-agent/`.

## Release & done

- PR-only to **`staging`** — see `.cursor/rules/pr-only-period.mdc` and `docs/pr-only-period.md`
- Work Board kanban is **retired** — work from chat + constitution, not canvas tasks
- Never mark done without deliverable gate: `bash scripts/run-deliverable-gate.sh` (`--full` for UI)
